        "start": 31
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Egbert argues in passing that the fact that he was operating under a \u201c `statutory . . . mandate' not invoked in prior cases,\u201d standing alone, \u201cdooms [Boule's] no-new-context argument.\u201d"
    },
